note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note OM-1 twin of v6-edit.om: elements 3..6 of a 10-byte row set to X through an offset, the
note lengths 2 and 4 printed in the same order. Expected stdout oracle/s5s7/exp/v6-edit.out (python3).
fn fill e edit uchar 10 o ulong k ulong c uchar to ulong
for i ulong k
put e add o i c
end
putd 2
ret k
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 10 46
m = fill a 3 4 88
nl = new uchar 1 10
w = write 1 a 0 10
w = write 1 nl 0 1
putd m
ret 0
end
